nization, Empty Subgraph Guard, Rapid Query Sequencing, and Responsive De-Illumination\n\n### Changed Files\n- [GraphCanvas.tsx](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx) (`ticket-001`, `ticket-002`, `ticket-003`):\n  - Synchronously bound `renderRef.current = render` in the [`GraphCanvas`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx#L17-L700) component body and initialized `d3.zoom` once on mount (`[]`), delegating `'zoom'` events to `renderRef.current()` so camera transitions and user gestures never invoke a stale pre-illumination closure.\n  - Added a dedicated reactive redraw `useEffect` (`[render, isIlluminated, activeNodePKs, activeEdgeKeys, selectedNode, hoveredNode]`) that executes `render()` synchronously and schedules a `requestAnimationFrame` repaint even when the D3 simulation has settled (`alpha \u003c alphaMin`).\n  - Added non-destructive `devicePixelRatio` buffer sizing inside `render()`, `window` `'resize'`, and `ResizeObserver` callbacks.\n  - Gated `isActive` and `isActiveEdge` strictly on `isIlluminated`, resolved link endpoints via `nodeByPk`, and rendered active nodes in gold/amber (`#ffb703` / [`CANVAS_PALETTE.accentAmber`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/styles/graph_theme.ts#L99-L110)) with `rgba(255, 183, 3, 0.45)` outer radial glow halos, `#f59e0b` inner halo rings, and high-contrast amber leader badges.\n  - Preserved full opacity (`alpha = 1.0`), a distinct outer dashed selection ring (`#38bdf8`) for `selectedNode`, active-radius-aware hit-testing in [`handlePointerDown`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx#L494-L519) and [`handlePointerMove`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx#L521-L549), and a non-blocking floating tooltip overlay (`data-testid=\"node-hover-tooltip\"`) for `hoveredNode`.\n  - Pre-ticked `d3.forceSimulation` when initial node `(x, y)` coordinates are undefined, ordered the camera framing `useEffect` after simulation and zoom initialization, called `renderRef.current()` at `t = 0ms`, interrupted in-flight transitions via `selection.interrupt()`, and attached `.on('end', () =\u003e renderRef.current())` in [`frameActiveSubgraph`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx#L40-L85).\n- [GraphSyncContext.tsx](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx) (`ticket-004`):\n  - Updated [`setIlluminatedPath`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L268-L280) to immediately clear `activeNodePKs` and `activeEdgeKeys` and set `isIlluminated` to `false` when `active_node_pks` is empty (`length === 0`).\n  - Added a monotonic request counter (`latestQueryIdRef`) in [`GraphSyncProvider`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L175-L482), removed the blocking `isQueryLoading` guard from [`submitInquiry`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L349-L416), and invalidated in-flight requests in [`clearIllumination`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L282-L288).\n- [AgentChatDrawer.tsx](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/sr